### 1. Login as an ACTIVE GALLERY account
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "active-gallery@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "gallery"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("galleryAccessToken", response.body.token.accessToken);
%}


### 2. Gallery creates an artist account (200 OK)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/gallery/add-artist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}

{
  "createUserDto": {
    "email": "gallery-artist@test.com",
    "password": "Password1234!",
    "userRole": "artiste"
  },
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "bio": "Contemporary painter exploring urban landscapes.",
  "portfolioUrl": "https://portfolio.example.com/john-doe",
  "nationality": "French"
}



### 3. Add an artist with an ALREADY EXISTING email (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/gallery/add-artist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}

{
  "createUserDto": {
    "email": "gallery-artist@test.com",
    "password": "Password1234!",
    "userRole": "artiste"
  },
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "bio": "Contemporary painter exploring urban landscapes.",
