### 4. Add an artist with an INVALID body (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/gallery/add-artist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}

{
  "createUserDto": {
    "email": "not-an-email",
    "password": "short",
    "userRole": "artiste"
  },
  "firstName": "",
  "portfolioUrl": "not-a-url"
}



### 5. Login as a (non-gallery) COLLECTOR account
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "collector@test.com",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "collector"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("collectorAccessToken", response.body.token.accessToken);
%}


### 6. Add an artist as a NON-GALLERY user (403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/gallery/add-artist
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{collectorAccessToken}}

{
  "createUserDto": {
    "email": "another-artist@test.com",
